{
  "id": "u15",
  "level": "A2",
  "number": 15,
  "title": "Past tense: het + ge-",
  "titleAf": "Die verlede tyd",
  "icon": "⏪",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "u15-1",
      "title": "One past tense",
      "explanation": [
        "Afrikaans has just **one** everyday past tense: **het** + the verb with **ge-** in front, placed at the end.",
        "**Ek eet.** (I eat) → **Ek het geëet.** (I ate / I have eaten)",
        "**Ek speel sokker.** → **Ek het sokker gespeel.** The **ge-** word goes to the end.",
        "Verbs that already start with **be-, ge-, her-, ont-, ver-** don't get an extra ge-: **Ek het verstaan.** **Ek het betaal.**",
        "New words: **sien** (see), **koop** (buy), **betaal** (pay), **see** (sea), **rekening** (bill)."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Ek het geëet.",
          "en": "I ate."
        },
        {
          "af": "Ons het sokker gespeel.",
          "en": "We played soccer."
        },
        {
          "af": "Sy het gister 'n boek gelees.",
          "en": "She read a book yesterday."
        },
        {
          "af": "Ek het nie verstaan nie.",
          "en": "I didn't understand."
        }
      ],
      "vocab": [
        "sien",
        "koop",
        "betaal",
        "see",
        "rekening"
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "type": "transform",
          "instruction": "Put it in the past",
          "from": "Ek eet brood.",
          "answers": [
            "Ek het brood geëet."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "transform",
          "instruction": "Put it in the past",
          "from": "Hulle speel sokker.",
          "answers": [
            "Hulle het sokker gespeel."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "transform",
          "instruction": "Put it in the past",
          "from": "Ons betaal die rekening.",
          "answers": [
            "Ons het die rekening betaal."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "order",
          "en": "She read a book yesterday.",
          "af": "Sy het gister 'n boek gelees."
        },
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "af": "Ek het 'n kar ___. (bought)",
          "en": "I bought a car.",
          "answers": [
            "gekoop"
          ],
          "options": [
            "gekoop",
            "koop",
            "gekoopt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "en",
          "prompt": "We saw the sea.",
          "answers": [
            "Ons het die see gesien."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "en",
          "prompt": "I didn't understand.",
          "answers": [
            "Ek het nie verstaan nie."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "u15-2",
      "title": "Was and had",
      "explanation": [
        "**is** → **was** (was / were): **Ek was moeg.**",
        "**hê** = to have. In the present it's **het**; in the past it's **het gehad** (had): **Ons het 'n lekker tyd gehad.** (We had a great time.) **tyd** = time."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Ek was gister siek.",
          "en": "I was sick yesterday."
        },
        {
          "af": "Ons het 'n lekker tyd gehad.",
          "en": "We had a great time."
        }
      ],
      "vocab": [
        "was",
        "tyd",
        "hê"
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "type": "transform",
          "instruction": "Put it in the past",
          "from": "Hy is moeg.",
          "answers": [
            "Hy was moeg."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "en",
          "prompt": "We had a great time.",
          "answers": [
            "Ons het 'n lekker tyd gehad."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "en",
          "prompt": "I was sick yesterday.",
          "answers": [
            "Ek was gister siek.",
            "Gister was ek siek."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "from": "af",
          "prompt": "Hulle was baie gelukkig.",
          "answers": [
            "They were very happy."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
